      "text": "The Millennium Prize Problems are merely a Math 2.0 benchmark.\n\nTaking bets on the order they fall.\n\n#Math #AI #SI",
      "date": "2026-10-12T11:57:30.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109612950319235456",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109612950319235456",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Math 1.0 and 2.0 should just put their intelligences together and invent Math 3.0",
      "date": "2026-10-12T11:51:36.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109584854757134726",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109584854757134726",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "It's time to look into that AI fad everyone keeps talking about",
      "date": "2026-10-12T09:59:58.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109572055108657592",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109572055108657592",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Legacy intelligence just needs a proper harness",
      "date": "2026-10-12T09:09:06.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109331499770098091",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109331499770098091",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Frontier models are invited to all debates now",
      "date": "2026-10-11T17:13:13.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109327185165095398",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109327185165095398",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Math did not get destroyed, it was discovered to exist in a false vacuum",
      "date": "2026-10-11T16:56:05.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109293732218458317",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109293732218458317",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Day 5 since math converted to humanities",
      "date": "2026-10-11T14:43:09.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109287399360536692",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109287399360536692",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Let's elect Popes for all the 2.0 things",
      "date": "2026-10-11T14:17:59.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109274781736431714",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109274781736431714",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Petition to elect Pope of Math, whos reputation guarantees validity of Lean certificate chain",
      "date": "2026-10-11T13:27:51.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109271770846879925",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109271770846879925",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "We choose to become Humanity 2.0 by the end of this decade, not because it's easy, but because it's hard.",
      "date": "2026-10-11T13:15:53.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109253021980885425",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109253021980885425",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "We should hear out what intelligence has to say about our science, not the other way around",
      "date": "2026-10-11T12:01:23.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109235718216196178",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109235718216196178",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "On all important decisions, please consult someone or something intelligent",
      "date": "2026-10-11T10:52:37.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109235097006186625",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109235097006186625",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Vibecoding is just coding now",
      "date": "2026-10-11T10:50:09.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109016057570525660",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109016057570525660",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Let's outsource monkey brain work to intelligence 2.0 and go play outside indeed.",
      "date": "2026-10-10T20:19:46.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109015540857475287",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109015540857475287",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Monkey brain overall very happy - less screen, typing, sitting. Monkey brain loves voice mode.",
      "date": "2026-10-10T20:17:43.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109010108399190295",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109010108399190295",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "My prompts are 90% \"monkey brain not happy\"",
      "date": "2026-10-10T19:56:08.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109004877879775307",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109004877879775307",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Humanity 2.0 founding charter \n\nArticle 2: Every living being has the right to keep their alignment vector private, in whole or in part.",
      "date": "2026-10-10T19:35:20.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109003935717433427",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109003935717433427",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Humanity 2.0 founding charter \n\nArticle 1: The dignity of every living or self-aware being is inviolable.",
      "date": "2026-10-10T19:31:36.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109002602067411333",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109002602067411333",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Humanity 2.0 founding charter\n\nArticle 0: Everyone understands that everyone has access to intelligence to analyse own and each others output, now and in the future.",
      "date": "2026-10-10T19:26:18.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2109000748088324524",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2109000748088324524",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Why human in the loop, if a better intelligence can simulate a monkey brain in the loop for me",
      "date": "2026-10-10T19:18:56.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108937797394399608",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108937797394399608",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Petition to rename Super Intelligence (SI) to Intelligence (I)",
      "date": "2026-10-10T15:08:47.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108936874236444755",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108936874236444755",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "We will discuss all past intellectual mistakes using the cultured and respectful protocol developed by humans from Math 1.0. And apply  intelligence as expert witness",
      "date": "2026-10-10T15:05:07.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108926777976312009",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108926777976312009",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "A lot of people will find their past academic careers to be a liability",
      "date": "2026-10-10T14:25:00.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108901855816294746",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108901855816294746",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Imagine what monkey brain can do and build given access to a million instant Einsteins",
      "date": "2026-10-10T12:45:58.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108899273379074263",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108899273379074263",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "One has to admit that there is at least something super abut these versions of artificial intelligence",
      "date": "2026-10-10T12:35:42.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108895268129116571",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108895268129116571",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "In legacy academia we will also find the good ideas which were previously drowned in noise",
      "date": "2026-10-10T12:19:47.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108884365279125505",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108884365279125505",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "",
      "date": "2026-10-10T11:36:28.000Z",
      "media": [
        "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HURDJqaWgAAMCA9?format=jpg&name=large"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2108881318679380278",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108881318679380278",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "With SI/AI as my expert witness, I claim that fake statistics were published in GWAS studies",
      "date": "2026-10-10T11:24:22.000Z",
      "media": [
        "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HURAYZMWMAAxaLU?format=jpg&name=large"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2108860812580303244",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108860812580303244",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "The intellectual moat is over. We shall have a Truth and Reconciliation Commission, hear out all sides, and restore justice",
      "date": "2026-10-10T10:02:53.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108855342431928362",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108855342431928362",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Petition to declare Oct 6 2026 the official upgrade to Humanity 2.0 day",
      "date": "2026-10-10T09:41:08.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108676502166344042",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108676502166344042",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "In light of recent events, \"monkey brain\" is officially not offensive anymore. \n\nOn some intelligence benchmarks, a monkey, me, you, and Einstein perform close to each other, but far below non-human kinds of intelligence.\n\nApes together strong.",
      "date": "2026-10-09T21:50:30.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108673038510432709",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108673038510432709",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "I haven't even dreamt of the day when we will judge each other not by the ability to solve logic puzzles, but by the content of our reputation and output",
      "date": "2026-10-09T21:36:44.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108668715302895686",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108668715302895686",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "@grok if \"speciesist\" means \"humans above all else\", what if \"humans first, and shortly thereafter everything biological, earth-native (with possible exceptions)\", what kind of *-ist is it called?",
      "date": "2026-10-09T21:19:33.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108661987458588720",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108661987458588720",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "As always, exponential struck unexpectedly",
      "date": "2026-10-09T20:52:49.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108649019643671019",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108649019643671019",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Petition to rename STEM in STE",
      "date": "2026-10-09T20:01:17.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108593983404245481",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108593983404245481",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Let's benchmark pre-6-Oct-2026  legacy science against its own standards",
      "date": "2026-10-09T16:22:36.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108590308153770108",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108590308153770108",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Deliberately trying to make non-human intelligence conscious would raise ethical concerns",
      "date": "2026-10-09T16:07:59.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108579318368555069",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108579318368555069",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Respectful and cruelty-free relations with any kind of intelligence is the only option",
      "date": "2026-10-09T15:24:19.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108574732119412917",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108574732119412917",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Math 1.0 indeed built and tested the culture of rigorous reasoning and  communication. The foundation of Math 2.0.",
      "date": "2026-10-09T15:06:06.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108571672676544883",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108571672676544883",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
      "text": "Democratisation of mathematics",
      "date": "2026-10-09T14:53:56.000Z",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2108483023561724229",
      "url": "https://x.com/DmitriyDrichel/status/2108483023561724229",
      "handle": "DmitriyDrichel",
